-- Tests of Histadrut HaMorim's clothing-allowance agreement of 19.7.2011
-- (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2011-07-19_teachers_bigud-rama-4-all-hora-workers.l4):
-- its condition held against the completion agreement it waits for, and
-- the agreement held against the deferral of 22.7.2013, which cuts what it
-- gave. They sit beside it and not in it (the client, 2026-10-22:
-- "assertions about a file should sit next to it, not be included in it");
-- agreements/teachers-general has no family root yet (MMS-548).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `2011-07-19_teachers_bigud-rama-4-all-hora-workers`
IMPORT `2013-07-22_ofek-hadash_last-phase-deferral`

§ `בדיקות ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 19.7.2011 (קצובת ביגוד)`

§§ `מול הסכם ההשלמה מיום 29.2.2012`

-- §3 waits for the completion agreement by 30.6.2012; it was signed on
-- 29.2.2012, 122 days before: the rise to level 4 stands, and no teacher
-- repays July 2011's difference.
#ASSERT (DATE_SERIAL `the completion agreement is due by` MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the signing of the completion agreement`) EQUALS 122
#ASSERT NOT `§3 of the 2011 clothing agreement takes effect` `the signing of the completion agreement`
#ASSERT `the July 2011 clothing difference to repay` 10 1000 800 `the signing of the completion agreement` EQUALS 0

§§ `מול ההסכם מיום 22.7.2013`

-- The deferral of 22.7.2013 sets the clothing allowance for תשע"ד at 84% of
-- the level by seniority — level 3 to 25 years, 25 included, level 4 above
-- — where this agreement gives level 4 to all; it says so, notwithstanding
-- any collective agreement (§6 ¶1), and keeps the protected payments on this
-- agreement's level (§7). For every seniority of 0 to 40 years, this
-- agreement's level is never below the deferral's, and above it exactly to
-- 25 years: an open cut, no finding.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                    `the clothing level for 5774` n AT MOST 4
                AND (`the clothing level for 5774` n LESS THAN 4) EQUALS (n AT MOST 25))
            (range 0 40)
#ASSERT `§6 overrides the clothing allowance of every other provision`
